01:00:11,250 --> 01:00:17,250
The Buckingham Murders is a 2023 Indian crime thriller film directed by Hansal Mehta and starring Kareena Kapoor Khan
as a grieving British-Indian detective who is assigned the case of a murdered child in Buckinghamshire.

10
01:06:52,500 --> 01:06:58,500
It is written by Aseem Arrora, Raghav Raj Kakker, and Kashyap Kapoor and
produced by Kareena Kapoor Khan, Shobha Kapoor and Ekta Kapoor.

11
01:13:33,750 --> 01:13:39,750
The film had its world premiere at the 67th BFI
London Film Festival on 14 October 2023.

12
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:21,000
It was theatrically released on 13 September 2024 to
generally positive reviews from critics.

13
01:26:56,250 --> 01:27:02,250
It received five nominations at 70th Filmfare Awards including  Best
Film (Critics) and Best Actress (Critics) (Kapoor).

14
01:33:37,500 --> 01:33:43,500
The film explores themes of mother, detective, grief, murder, murder mystery.

15
01:40:18,750 --> 01:40:24,750
The tone is intense and mind_bending.
